OL,3,GNEWSAWater saving urged despite
OL,4,Aabove-average rainfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company has urged customers to
OL,7,Fuse less water despite above-average
OL,8,Frainfall in October.
OL,10,FPortsmouth Water said groundwater
OL,11,Flevels had suffered from the hot, dry
OL,12,Fsummer.
OL,14,FIt said levels were 2m (6.6ft) below
OL,15,Faverage, but needed to be higher than
OL,16,Fnormal to be sure of avoiding a
OL,17,Fhosepipe ban next year.
OL,19,FIn a Facebook post, the firm asked
OL,20,Fcustomers to turn off running taps,
OL,21,Fswitch showerheads and repair leaky
OL,22,Ftoilets.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
